# Custom Detection Rules: SSH Brute Force & Reflected XSS Detection

## Objective

Build and tune custom Wazuh detection rules for two distinct attack categories:

- **SSH brute-force login attempts** — host-based, authentication log source.
- **Reflected Cross-Site Scripting (XSS)** against DVWA — web-based, Apache access log source.

Validate that each rule fires correctly and maps to the appropriate MITRE ATT&CK technique.

